        "Content": "Mass concrete construction - Built c. 1930. \r\nOil fired central heating. \r\nOriginal ornate features and beautiful high ceilings (height 2.8m).\r\nMix of double glazed PVC and single glazed teak windows. \r\nAttic is insulated and part boarded.\r\nA secure front garden with pedestrian access. \r\nFully enclosed south west facing courtyard with patio area, pedestrian access, built-in water fountain and raised flower beds."
